<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - St. Jude Medical cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - St. Jude Medical cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Amelia McDonald downgraded St. Jude Medical Inc to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- In a note, she cited St. Jude's &quot;stagnant base business.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1-1/2 to 31-3/4.</p>
</text>
